      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The earlier bail application of the petitioner was rejected vide Annexure-P/1 to the present application taking into account that altogether 121 kg ganja was alleged to have been recovered from the house of the petitioner and in the light of Section 37 of N.D.P.S. Act, the petitioner was not entitled for bail.",
